* ''The ward's reach'' (operator and house, talk-story). Every act that reads the persona-root seed and changes who belongs to the face or what the face trusts becomes a ward act: admit, fleet-join, recovery-contact enrolment, handle and nexus publication, the founder certificate, the seal ceremony and a holder's edge kāpae, beside the bound acts of 2026-11-04. A root-reading act measured to run unattended moves to the device-atom signature under the face grant chain and prompts for nothing. One prompt per act, never cached. A face whose ward tree stands absent refuses bound acts by name (`ward-absent`) and returns through `lares vault restore`. The operator's real face is born with its ward key at the fresh founding. `F11`'s vault and admit verbs ride the same ward.

